    {"budgetMs":{"max":5000,"min":500},"description":"The server at a glance, in seven statements: SQL Server's CPU (its schedulers' non-preemptive time) and scheduler delay, waiting tasks (wait time less signal wait of every type that is not benign), database I/O and its latency, batch requests, compilations and re-compilations, blocked sessions and the longest block, active requests, user sessions and logins, runnable tasks per scheduler and the work queue, memory grants, page life expectancy, deadlocks and lock waits. Rates use the server's own clock (ms_ticks), and a restart starts them again; a statement the login may not run leaves only its own series null.","filterMode":"none","gates":{"editions":[1,2,3,4,8],"minMajor":13},"id":"activity.overview","intervalMs":{"default":2000,"max":60000,"min":1000},"label":"Overview","maxDutyCycle":0.2,"minGapMs":0,"permission":"serverState","series":[{"counter":"cpuPercent","id":"cpuPercent","label":"SQL Server CPU","unit":"percent"},{"counter":"msPerSecond","id":"schedulerDelay","label":"Scheduler delay","unit":"msPerSecond"},{"counter":"msPerSecond","id":"waitingTasks","label":"Waiting tasks","unit":"msPerSecond"},{"counter":"rate","id":"ioMegabytes","label":"Database I/O","unit":"bytesPerSecond"},{"counter":"ratio","id":"readLatency","label":"Read latency","unit":"ms"},{"counter":"ratio","id":"writeLatency","label":"Write latency","unit":"ms"},{"counter":"rate","id":"batchRequests","label":"Batch requests","unit":"perSecond"},{"counter":"rate","id":"compilations","label":"Compilations","unit":"perSecond"},{"counter":"rate","id":"recompilations","label":"Recompilations","unit":"perSecond"},{"counter":"gauge","id":"blockedSessions","label":"Blocked sessions","unit":"count"},{"counter":"gauge","id":"longestBlock","label":"Longest block","unit":"ms"},{"counter":"gauge","id":"activeRequests","label":"Active requests","unit":"count"},{"counter":"gauge","id":"userSessions","label":"User sessions","unit":"count"},{"counter":"rate","id":"logins","label":"Logins","unit":"perSecond"},{"counter":"gauge","id":"runnablePerScheduler","label":"Runnable tasks","unit":"count"},{"counter":"gauge","id":"workQueue","label":"Work queue","unit":"count"},{"counter":"gauge","id":"grantsPending","label":"Memory grants pending","unit":"count"},{"counter":"gauge","id":"grantsOutstanding","label":"Memory grants outstanding","unit":"count"},{"counter":"gauge","id":"pageLifeExpectancy","label":"Page life expectancy","unit":"seconds"},{"counter":"rate","id":"deadlocks","label":"Deadlocks","unit":"perSecond"},{"counter":"rate","id":"lockWaits","label":"Lock waits","unit":"perSecond"}],"source":"activity","status":[],"tables":[],"views":[]},
    {"budgetMs":{"max":5000,"min":500},"description":"Processes (one row per session, its MARS requests folded), the blocking chains as rows (built in the backend from task waits, each session once) and Active Expensive Queries, from one sample. Rates are per session and per request between samples, keyed by login time or start time, so a reused id never gives a rate across two sessions. Varia's own sessions are marked, and system sessions and Varia's pools are hidden unless the filter shows them. Without server state, Processes shows only the monitor's own session and the other two tables report PERMISSION_DENIED without running SQL. Its two series follow the Details flyout's session (focusSession).","filterMode":"memory","gates":{"editions":[1,2,3,4,8],"minMajor":13},"id":"activity.sessions","intervalMs":{"default":2000,"max":60000,"min":1000},"label":"Sessions","maxDutyCycle":0.2,"minGapMs":0,"permission":"none","series":[{"counter":"gauge","id":"focus.cpuRate","label":"Session CPU","unit":"msPerSecond"},{"counter":"gauge","id":"focus.logicalReadsRate","label":"Session logical reads","unit":"perSecond"}],"source":"activity","status":["serverState","canKill"],"tables":[{"columns":[{"dataType":"int","id":"sessionId","name":"Session ID"},{"dataType":"nvarchar","id":"status","name":"Status"},{"dataType":"nvarchar","id":"login","name":"Login"},{"dataType":"nvarchar","id":"database","name":"Database"},{"dataType":"nvarchar","id":"command","name":"Command"},{"dataType":"nvarchar","id":"application","name":"Application"},{"dataType":"nvarchar","id":"waitType","name":"Wait Type"},{"dataType":"bigint","id":"waitTimeMs","name":"Wait Time (ms)"},{"dataType":"nvarchar","id":"waitResource","name":"Wait Resource"},{"dataType":"int","id":"blockedBy","name":"Blocked By"},{"dataType":"bit","id":"headBlocker","name":"Head Blocker"},{"dataType":"int","id":"blocking","name":"Blocking"},{"dataType":"decimal","id":"cpuRate","name":"CPU (ms/s)"},{"dataType":"bigint","id":"totalCpuMs","n